WEBVTT

00:05:58.776 --> 00:06:00.422
that can hear them and find them.

00:06:00.446 --> 00:06:03.204
So the way I picture it is,
they just sort of roam around

00:06:03.228 --> 00:06:06.538
being like, "Are you my mother?
Are you my mother? Are you my mother?"

00:06:06.562 --> 00:06:09.024
And every single human
who is struck by inspiration

00:06:09.048 --> 00:06:11.204
describes the experience
exactly the same way.

00:06:11.228 --> 00:06:13.365
It's a very mystical experience.

00:06:13.389 --> 00:06:15.159
There's chills.

00:06:15.183 --> 00:06:17.857
There's a feeling of your stomach
kind of getting upset.

00:06:17.881 --> 00:06:20.439
There's a dampness
on the back of your neck.

00:06:20.463 --> 00:06:22.866
There's that uneasy feeling
of falling in love

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:24.409
or about to jump off a cliff.

00:06:24.433 --> 00:06:25.625
There's nervousness,

00:06:25.649 --> 00:06:27.300
and then there's this distraction,

00:06:27.324 --> 00:06:29.052
where the idea sort of consumes you,

00:06:29.076 --> 00:06:33.314
and in that consuming,
which can take months, weeks, years,